<title>MALAYSIA: Kelanamas, Perstima suspended.</title>
<headline>Kelanamas, Perstima suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Kelanamas Industries Bhd and Perusahaan Sadur Timah Malaysia Bhd (Perstima) were suspended on Monday pending news announcements, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) said.</p>
<p>Kelanamas is involved in distribution of consumer products, granite quarrying and other activities. Perstima makes and sells tinplate.  </p>
<p>Shares of Kelanamas were up 40 cents to 4.58 ringgit and Perstima gained 1.00 to 11.90 ringgit prior to the suspension.</p>
<p>Officials at the companies could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
